WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.465
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:04.735 --> 00:06.278
[toilet flushing]

3
00:08.780 --> 00:10.324
[Satoshi breathes heavily]

4
00:10.407 --> 00:15.162
The reason I applied is because I'm interested in advertising.

5
00:15.245 --> 00:17.122
[stomach growling]

6
00:17.205 --> 00:18.999
[groans] Maybe restroom again?

7
00:19.082 --> 00:22.002
It's Kyobashi, right? You gotta hurry.

8
00:22.085 --> 00:24.796
What if I have diarrhea on the train today?

9
00:25.047 --> 00:27.549
No diarrhea allowed on any day.

10
00:30.510 --> 00:33.055
Chiko, you need to be more serious.

11
00:34.014 --> 00:35.307
What did you say?

12
00:35.390 --> 00:37.351
[Satoshi] Oh, my bag.

13
00:44.232 --> 00:45.817
-[sighs] -[door opens]

14
01:04.419 --> 01:06.046
[indistinct chatter]

15
01:06.129 --> 01:09.466
[employee] Yes, of course. Thanks, I'm counting on you.

16
01:15.472 --> 01:17.891
-[stomach growling] -[groans]

17
01:17.974 --> 01:22.354
RED LIGHT ELEGY

18
01:23.188 --> 01:25.023
-[knocking on door] -[employee] Boss.

19
01:25.440 --> 01:27.150
-The applicant is here. -[employer] Okay.

20
01:27.234 --> 01:28.235
Just get inside.

21
01:28.318 --> 01:30.445
-Pardon me. -[employer] Come on in.

22
01:31.988 --> 01:32.989
Come sit here.

23
01:51.466 --> 01:54.094
-A female? -Huh?

24
01:57.013 --> 01:58.140
You're a female.

25
01:58.890 --> 02:00.642
Can't females apply here?

26
02:05.147 --> 02:06.314
[employer] It's male here.

27
02:07.941 --> 02:10.110
-[gasps] -[♪ tense music playing]

28
02:10.986 --> 02:13.071
Wait... Excuse me!

29
02:22.247 --> 02:23.957
-[staff] Next person, please. -[interviewee 1] Yes!

30
02:30.922 --> 02:33.300
I wanna take a call.

31
02:33.383 --> 02:36.303
I'm up to here now. Can you hold my spot?

32
02:36.386 --> 02:37.888
[line ringing]

33
02:43.643 --> 02:46.813
[interviewee 2] Hey, bro, it's your turn.

34
02:48.356 --> 02:49.608
Got it.

35
02:50.984 --> 02:52.110
[knocking on door]

36
02:53.153 --> 02:54.821
-The applicant is coming. -[interviewer] Okay.

37
02:54.905 --> 02:56.198
Pardon me.

38
02:56.615 --> 02:58.492
[interviewer] Hand in your résumé and be seated.

39
02:59.284 --> 03:01.286
Well... Actually, I...

40
03:01.369 --> 03:04.039
Can you hurry up? People are waiting.

41
03:04.331 --> 03:06.458
[Satoshi] I'm sorry.

42
03:08.084 --> 03:11.129
Well... Actually...

43
03:12.339 --> 03:13.924
[hurried footsteps approaching]

44
03:14.007 --> 03:15.217
This one!

45
03:15.300 --> 03:17.552
Chiko! What are you doing here?

46
03:17.636 --> 03:19.054
Whatever.

47
03:19.137 --> 03:22.516
-What about your interview? -Idiot. Focus on yours.

48
03:23.642 --> 03:26.061
-[Chiko] I'm leaving. -[Satoshi] Thanks...

49
03:26.144 --> 03:27.479
Thanks a lot!

50
03:29.272 --> 03:30.357
[sighs]

51
03:32.484 --> 03:36.071
Can we just start our interview?

52
03:38.615 --> 03:39.866
Yes!

53
03:45.163 --> 03:46.957
Let's do it.

54
03:48.291 --> 03:49.459
I'm ready.

55
03:51.378 --> 03:54.589
Can we start with why you applied here?

56
03:54.673 --> 03:55.966
Yes!

57
03:56.049 --> 03:59.803
To begin with, I've always enjoyed watching commercials.

58
04:01.179 --> 04:02.222
[sighs]

59
04:11.815 --> 04:13.316
[line ringing]

60
04:17.529 --> 04:19.990
Hello. This is Akiyama speaking.

61
04:20.782 --> 04:22.158
Yes, I am.

62
04:22.868 --> 04:24.744
I'm sorry for the trouble.

63
04:26.204 --> 04:27.539
Yes. Well...

64
04:29.457 --> 04:30.500
What?

65
04:30.584 --> 04:31.793
Boring.

66
04:32.878 --> 04:36.631
Everything I read and hear just flow right past me.

67
04:37.340 --> 04:38.717
Well...

68
04:38.800 --> 04:43.096
[interviewer] You're just repeating what you read, right?

69
04:43.179 --> 04:45.640
[scoffs] That's so obvious.

70
04:45.724 --> 04:47.225
No, I just--

71
04:47.309 --> 04:49.227
[interviewer] What are your strengths?

72
04:49.644 --> 04:52.314
-Guess you only know your weaknesses. -[stomach growling]

73
04:52.981 --> 04:54.566
If you don't look ahead

74
04:54.649 --> 04:57.944
and brace yourself to ride out the rough waves of this world,

75
04:58.486 --> 05:00.488
-you end up like you. -[♪ tense music playing]

76
05:00.572 --> 05:04.367
-Don't you ever think about your future? -[rumbling continues]

77
05:05.952 --> 05:07.954
No, I--

78
05:08.038 --> 05:11.708
That delinquent chick is your girl, right?

79
05:12.167 --> 05:14.711
Those people just live aimlessly.

80
05:14.794 --> 05:18.340
Then they have kids recklessly

81
05:18.423 --> 05:20.926
-and waste social welfare. -[♪ tense music continues]

82
05:21.551 --> 05:23.929
Who'd want to pay taxes for them?

83
05:26.932 --> 05:28.767
Chiko is a good girl!

84
05:29.476 --> 05:34.356
Isn't judging people you don't know making the world even worse?

85
05:36.483 --> 05:38.318
Well, well, well.

86
05:39.861 --> 05:42.530
Now you can speak out in your own words

87
05:43.949 --> 05:45.992
despite failing the interview.

88
05:49.204 --> 05:51.790
I'll live a happy life with Chiko.

89
05:51.873 --> 05:55.794
That's way better, and that's why I'm getting a job.

90
05:56.336 --> 05:57.504
So long!

91
06:03.802 --> 06:05.845
Hey, how was it?

92
06:07.472 --> 06:12.519
No way, I completely blew it. I took job hunting too lightly.

93
06:13.395 --> 06:16.231
Sorry, after all your trouble bringing my résumé.

94
06:16.314 --> 06:17.649
Not at all.

95
06:18.942 --> 06:20.527
How about you?

96
06:22.070 --> 06:24.614
Well...

97
06:25.740 --> 06:27.951
I'm hired.

98
06:28.284 --> 06:31.246
What? Really? That's great!

99
06:32.455 --> 06:34.541
-Wow! -Are you all right?

100
06:35.083 --> 06:38.753
I'm fine. I'm not gonna let one failure get me down!

101
06:39.295 --> 06:42.716
Right? Now let's celebrate Chiko first!

102
06:42.799 --> 06:44.592
Do it at home.

103
06:45.093 --> 06:46.302
I'll grab some beers.

104
06:47.095 --> 06:49.097
-Congrats! -Okay.

105
06:54.853 --> 06:57.939
-[employer] Good morning. -Good morning.

106
06:59.149 --> 07:00.442
Shall we go now?

107
07:07.782 --> 07:10.577
Let's start with learning the delivery routes.

108
07:10.660 --> 07:11.703
[Chiko] Got it.

109
07:13.037 --> 07:18.168
You'll have company at first, then you'll drive solo once you're set.

110
07:18.251 --> 07:19.461
[Chiko] Understood.

111
07:21.129 --> 07:22.964
[engine starts]

112
07:32.390 --> 07:33.725
All right!

113
07:34.476 --> 07:35.810
Then, off I go.

114
07:35.894 --> 07:37.395
Take care of yourself.

115
07:37.812 --> 07:38.980
See you.

116
08:03.004 --> 08:04.088
[sighs]

117
08:10.678 --> 08:12.680
[store owner] "Extremely clumsy," huh?

118
08:12.764 --> 08:15.767
Cooking is all about hand skills.

119
08:15.850 --> 08:19.062
It's hard to hire someone with a résumé like this.

120
08:19.145 --> 08:22.982
You need to speak more clearly if you work in service.

121
08:29.447 --> 08:32.325
Sales is all about hands-on practice.

122
08:32.742 --> 08:34.369
Shall we try the practical test?

123
08:35.370 --> 08:37.372
-Yes. -[doorbell chimes]

124
08:37.914 --> 08:39.332
[resident] Coming.

125
08:43.127 --> 08:44.462
Yes, who's this?

126
08:44.546 --> 08:47.799
Well, we're giving this air purifier free

127
08:47.882 --> 08:51.719
to anyone who signs up to test it.

128
08:52.470 --> 08:54.639
-Here you are. -Oh...

129
08:54.722 --> 08:56.933
Wait, it's free?

130
08:57.016 --> 08:58.143
Yes.

131
08:59.435 --> 09:01.938
But you have to buy the filter for 10,000 yen.

132
09:02.647 --> 09:04.149
What's that? [scoffs]

133
09:04.232 --> 09:06.192
-Don't mess with me! -Huh?

134
09:06.276 --> 09:09.112
-You're a scammer, aren't you? -A scammer?

135
09:09.195 --> 09:11.239
[resident] Aren't you ashamed of selling like this?

136
09:11.322 --> 09:12.532
No, no. I'm not a scam--

137
09:12.615 --> 09:14.951
[resident] Anyway, the old guy in that room...

138
09:16.494 --> 09:17.579
[door opens]

139
09:17.912 --> 09:19.122
[Chiko] I'm back.

140
09:19.747 --> 09:20.874
[door closes]

141
09:26.588 --> 09:28.006
Failed again today?

142
09:29.340 --> 09:30.341
[Satoshi] Yeah.

143
09:37.682 --> 09:40.101
You got scared and panicked again, right?

144
09:40.518 --> 09:44.105
Just talk big, saying you'd die for this job!

145
09:47.192 --> 09:48.443
[Satoshi sighs]

146
09:50.320 --> 09:54.699
[Satoshi] People do die working, just like my dad.

147
09:55.867 --> 09:58.453
-Uh... -[Satoshi sighs]

148
10:00.038 --> 10:02.540
-Sorry. -Off to the convenience store.

149
10:05.418 --> 10:07.670
-[door opens] -[breathing heavily]

150
10:09.923 --> 10:11.090
[door closes]

151
10:13.593 --> 10:16.262
[♪ pensive music playing]

152
10:46.459 --> 10:48.086
Well, you'll do.

153
10:51.631 --> 10:52.674
Yes?

154
10:53.716 --> 10:54.968
[Satoshi] Thank you so much.

155
11:09.524 --> 11:10.525
[grunts]

156
11:16.322 --> 11:19.075
-[phone beeping] -[indistinct chatter]

157
11:36.259 --> 11:38.678
-Excuse me. -[seller] Welcome!

158
11:40.096 --> 11:41.472
Get me the prime cuts.

159
11:41.556 --> 11:42.932
[seller] Prime cuts? Sure!

160
11:43.641 --> 11:45.059
Get the pricy stuff.

161
11:45.143 --> 11:48.604
[seller] Pricy stuff. All right. Premium meat!

162
11:48.688 --> 11:51.107
[♪ soft bright music playing]

163
12:07.165 --> 12:08.291
[sighs]

164
12:13.921 --> 12:18.843
Hey, you! It's you. What the hell are you thinking?

165
12:19.260 --> 12:21.262
Man, you're way too drunk.

166
12:22.347 --> 12:26.976
The manager wants to call it a day.

167
12:27.060 --> 12:28.227
[chuckles]

168
12:32.190 --> 12:37.904
What? You looking down on me? [laughs]

169
12:37.987 --> 12:40.031
Yusaku-kun, knock it off.

170
12:40.114 --> 12:43.242
[drunk] Hey, just say something.

171
12:43.326 --> 12:46.162
What? You wanna fight?

172
12:46.954 --> 12:52.251
All size, no fight. Hey, come on. [laughs]

173
12:54.170 --> 12:56.881
-[store owner] Yusaku-kun, stop it! -[customers yelp]

174
12:58.841 --> 12:59.967
[drunk groans]

175
13:00.968 --> 13:02.178
[drunk] That hurts!

176
13:02.261 --> 13:04.972
[breathing heavily, angrily]

177
13:05.056 --> 13:06.641
[Chiko] Let go of me!

178
13:07.475 --> 13:09.811
-[grunts] -[Yusaku breathing heavily, angrily]

179
13:12.772 --> 13:14.440
Yu... Yusaku.

180
13:48.599 --> 13:50.017
Chiko...

181
13:51.894 --> 13:55.314
[soft groan] Just finished it, right?

182
14:00.069 --> 14:02.488
I'm too nervous to sleep.

183
14:03.114 --> 14:07.493
I've never touched a computer. Am I gonna make it?

184
14:10.121 --> 14:11.122
[sighs]

185
14:13.166 --> 14:15.251
What kind of a company?

186
14:15.334 --> 14:16.586
Making websites.

187
14:16.669 --> 14:18.045
What kind?

188
14:21.048 --> 14:24.802
Websites are websites! Using a computer.

189
14:25.845 --> 14:28.931
Don't you know what your company does?

190
14:30.183 --> 14:34.228
It's fine, it looked like a real office.

191
14:35.688 --> 14:36.814
Is that so?

192
14:40.151 --> 14:42.361
[whines] Chiko...

193
14:42.445 --> 14:43.988
Give it a rest!

194
14:46.949 --> 14:48.534
[gasping]

195
14:50.953 --> 14:52.288
Right on the mark.

196
14:52.371 --> 14:54.123
[Chiko] Who cares? Just sleep.

197
14:58.836 --> 15:01.005
-This is good. -[employee] Right?

198
15:01.088 --> 15:04.634
The pictures we've got here...

199
15:04.717 --> 15:07.136
[indistinct chatter]

200
15:07.220 --> 15:09.639
A nice one, right?

201
15:09.722 --> 15:10.723
PACKED WITH HOTTIES!

202
15:10.806 --> 15:14.936
[manager] "Japan Nightlife Chronicle". You and Hikasa-kun are taking on this.

203
15:15.436 --> 15:19.065
The rest do foodie blogs and all sorts of sites,

204
15:19.148 --> 15:21.859
but adult content pays the best.

205
15:22.318 --> 15:25.363
It's the backbone of our company.

206
15:26.822 --> 15:30.493
Cover her face well so her identity stays hidden.

207
15:31.202 --> 15:32.495
And then...

208
15:32.578 --> 15:35.414
retouch this girl's blemishes.

209
15:35.873 --> 15:40.044
This girl has so much hair sticking out.

210
15:40.378 --> 15:41.754
Erase all.

211
15:42.129 --> 15:45.675
I have a few requests, so just edit the photos based on those.

212
15:45.758 --> 15:47.885
[employee] Mr. Nakazono, time for the meeting.

213
15:47.969 --> 15:49.095
Okay!

214
15:49.929 --> 15:51.722
Follow the manual and try.

215
15:53.391 --> 15:56.018
-Hikasa-kun, we have guests today. -Got it!

216
15:56.644 --> 15:58.229
[curtain rattling]

217
16:00.189 --> 16:02.525
-[employee] This is what we discussed... -[Nakazono] Right.

218
16:05.903 --> 16:07.405
-[customer] The last one? -[Chiko's colleague] Yes.

219
16:09.031 --> 16:10.074
[customer] And what?

220
16:10.157 --> 16:12.243
-Is this lady in charge? -[Chiko's colleague] Yes.

221
16:12.326 --> 16:14.495
I'm starting long-haul routes tomorrow.

222
16:17.790 --> 16:19.959
Well, a woman is fine.

223
16:20.668 --> 16:22.378
As long as she's punctual.

224
16:23.129 --> 16:24.422
I'll do my best.

225
16:33.806 --> 16:35.891
[Chiko's colleague] That's not even late.

226
16:38.602 --> 16:41.939
-Don't sweat it. -All right, I don't.

227
16:43.858 --> 16:45.526
-[Chiko's colleague 1] Thanks for today. -[employer] Thanks.

228
16:46.819 --> 16:48.237
[employer] Settling in?

229
16:48.321 --> 16:49.905
Well, kind of.

230
16:56.037 --> 16:57.038
[Chiko's colleague 2] Hello.

231
17:10.009 --> 17:16.891
TAMAHIME. ALL FOR LOVE.

232
17:33.991 --> 17:36.285
What the hell are you looking at, idiot?

233
17:36.869 --> 17:38.788
[tuts, yells]

234
17:38.871 --> 17:39.955
[exclaims]

235
17:40.456 --> 17:44.168
No way! She's actually so cute!

236
17:44.585 --> 17:46.379
I think this is his girlfriend.

237
17:46.462 --> 17:47.630
[Nakazono] Girlfriend?

238
17:47.713 --> 17:49.882
-[Hikasa] Cute, right? -Cute.

239
17:49.965 --> 17:51.967
This type is the best.

240
17:52.051 --> 17:53.302
[Satoshi's colleague 1] The best?

241
17:53.386 --> 17:54.887
Not the best choice, huh?

242
17:54.970 --> 17:57.264
-[Hikasa] Which one is it? -[chuckles] What a match.

243
17:57.348 --> 18:00.518
That's so unfair. Let's drink!

244
18:00.601 --> 18:02.353
Drink, just drink.

245
18:02.436 --> 18:05.815
It's on the boss today, so drink up!

246
18:05.898 --> 18:07.024
[Nakazono] Go for it.

247
18:08.984 --> 18:10.695
-Wonderful. -[clapping]

248
18:10.778 --> 18:12.530
[Satoshi's colleague 2] Hikasa, drink up too.

249
18:12.613 --> 18:13.739
[Hikasa] I'll drink then.

250
18:13.823 --> 18:16.367
Oh, for real.

251
18:17.410 --> 18:18.536
Well...

252
18:19.704 --> 18:23.082
Nice that your girl lets you do this job.

253
18:23.958 --> 18:26.210
Well, actually...

254
18:26.877 --> 18:28.587
Wait, you haven't told her yet?

255
18:28.671 --> 18:30.214
Not yet.

256
18:30.297 --> 18:32.133
I wasn't too sure myself.

257
18:34.760 --> 18:37.763
All because Mr. Nakazono hadn't told you.

258
18:38.723 --> 18:40.725
You looked committed to this.

259
18:41.684 --> 18:44.687
There's no escape once you enter the sex industry.

260
18:48.065 --> 18:50.401
But you can still give it your all.

261
18:51.986 --> 18:54.780
You're not doing bad things at all.

262
18:56.073 --> 18:58.242
I'd be fine if I were your girlfriend.

263
19:01.245 --> 19:04.707
[Satoshi's colleague 1] Oh, Kubocchi has a crush on the new guy!

264
19:04.790 --> 19:06.667
[Kubocchi] No, that's not it!

265
19:06.751 --> 19:10.129
-Trust me, rookie. Choose Kubocchi! -What?

266
19:10.212 --> 19:12.047
You two make a good pair.

267
19:12.131 --> 19:13.466
-[Kubocchi] Sorry? -[Satoshi's colleague 1] This girl...

268
19:13.549 --> 19:15.676
has never been with a guy at all.

269
19:15.760 --> 19:18.804
-So please! -Hold on, what are you talking about?

270
19:18.888 --> 19:21.557
You're down because you know it's a sex site, right?

271
19:21.640 --> 19:23.267
-I know it. -[Nakazono] Really?

272
19:23.350 --> 19:24.852
If you wanna quit,

273
19:24.935 --> 19:28.981
you might as well get a new girl first.

274
19:29.064 --> 19:30.566
[Kubocchi] That's alcohol hazing! Enough!

275
19:30.649 --> 19:34.403
Well, I'll do my best at this job!

276
19:37.865 --> 19:39.784
[all exclaim]

277
19:39.867 --> 19:42.453
-Nice! -[indistinct chatter]

278
19:42.536 --> 19:43.954
Face off, face off!

279
19:44.038 --> 19:45.039
Get ready.

280
19:45.122 --> 19:46.916
-Do or die, Akiyama! -Go for it!

281
19:46.999 --> 19:48.292
Relax, relax.

282
19:48.375 --> 19:51.045
[Chiko's colleague 1] All right. Ready... Go!

283
19:51.128 --> 19:52.922
[Chiko's colleagues cheering] Go!

284
19:53.005 --> 19:55.049
Don't give up!

285
19:55.132 --> 19:59.094
My, you're still just a mama's girl!

286
19:59.178 --> 20:02.556
Wonder if you're even a challenge.

287
20:02.640 --> 20:06.602
-Shut up, old lady! -[excited cheering]

288
20:06.685 --> 20:07.895
[thuds]

289
20:07.978 --> 20:10.439
[shouting] Yes!

290
20:11.148 --> 20:14.068
-[Chiko's colleague 2] Ms. Tamayo rules! -Damn it!

291
20:14.151 --> 20:16.070
[laughs]

292
20:16.612 --> 20:19.323
-Bring it on anytime! -[groans]

293
20:19.406 --> 20:22.034
Not gonna lie, you've got real guts.

294
20:22.618 --> 20:25.454
I heard you wanna do long-haul routes.

295
20:26.080 --> 20:28.332
-Kind of. -Hell yeah!

296
20:28.415 --> 20:30.501
[laughs]

297
20:31.752 --> 20:33.504
-I love it! -[bell jingling]

298
20:35.339 --> 20:36.966
Even so,

299
20:37.049 --> 20:41.428
it is a lonely job, hitting endless,

300
20:41.512 --> 20:43.472
brutal roads all by yourself.

301
20:44.807 --> 20:46.559
You won't see your guy

302
20:46.642 --> 20:50.271
-or your family for days. -[Chiko's colleague 1] Right.

303
20:50.354 --> 20:51.897
Better be ready for that.

304
20:53.065 --> 20:54.942
I'm all good.

305
20:55.025 --> 20:57.236
That's the spirit! Good!

306
20:58.487 --> 20:59.864
Still,

307
21:00.364 --> 21:05.536
loneliness hits hard as you age.

308
21:06.370 --> 21:09.999
Just think about that... carefully!

309
21:10.082 --> 21:12.751
Ouch... That hurts, you old bitch!

310
21:12.835 --> 21:15.004
[Tamayo] Shut up, you little brat!

311
21:17.464 --> 21:18.799
[phone vibrating]

312
21:24.763 --> 21:25.931
Hi.

313
21:27.433 --> 21:29.685
[Satoshi slurring] Hi, Chiko.

314
21:30.185 --> 21:31.770
You're totally drunk.

315
21:32.187 --> 21:34.273
[Satoshi] I'm totally fine.

316
21:34.356 --> 21:36.108
-[Satoshi's phone thuds] -[Kubocchi yelps]

317
21:37.109 --> 21:38.235
[Satoshi] Ms. Kubo...

318
21:38.736 --> 21:40.779
[Satoshi's colleague 1] Ah, Kubocchi is flirting!

319
21:40.863 --> 21:41.906
[line disconnects]

320
21:43.407 --> 21:45.826
[indistinct chatter]

321
21:52.875 --> 21:54.501
Oh, I'll beat you this time!

322
21:56.795 --> 21:59.048
[Satoshi] Your face is spinning around.

323
21:59.131 --> 22:01.926
[Kubocchi] I told you not to let him drink so much.

324
22:02.009 --> 22:05.721
-Because you were so pushy. -[Kubocchi] Please stop that!

325
22:05.804 --> 22:07.806
[Hikasa] If you can't drink, just say so.

326
22:07.890 --> 22:09.892
I'm okay! [chuckles]

327
22:10.392 --> 22:11.810
[Nakazono] Well, he seems good.

328
22:11.894 --> 22:13.145
[Kubocchi] Are you all right?

329
22:13.228 --> 22:14.730
I'm sorry.

330
22:15.648 --> 22:18.275
[Kubocchi] Yanagawa-kun... [echoing]

331
22:20.736 --> 22:23.072
Are you all right? [echoing]

332
22:27.034 --> 22:30.037
-[indistinct chatter] -[birds chirping]

333
23:00.359 --> 23:01.527
No way.

334
23:02.361 --> 23:04.780
[♪ comical music playing]

335
23:07.658 --> 23:09.284
[indistinct chatter]

336
23:28.929 --> 23:31.765
[whimpering] What the heck?

337
23:33.142 --> 23:38.063
OSAKA'S TOP FOOD PICK MENCHIKATSU (DEEP-FRIED MEAT CUTLET)

338
23:38.147 --> 23:40.149
[♪ light music playing]

339
23:40.899 --> 23:42.401
[sizzling]

340
23:46.488 --> 23:47.906
[seller] Here you go.

341
23:48.699 --> 23:49.825
[crunches]

342
23:49.908 --> 23:51.076
It's hot!

343
23:58.042 --> 24:02.963
KAKUZAKI BUTCHER SHOP

344
24:03.047 --> 24:05.466
[♪ closing theme music playing]
